  "justification": "AniDB 10726 is the two I'll Be Here films, Past (2015-03-14) and Future (2015-04-25), which the node already places on TVDB 272697 0x14 and 0x15. TMDB 61695 season 0 has no film: its E1 and E2, where the node put them, are Idol Trial #1 and #2. TMDB lists the films as movies 311056 (Past, 2015-03-15, 82 min) and 333622 (Future, 2015-04-25, 90 min), which TheTVDB's movie entries link with IMDb tt4531412 and tt4539114. Its special S1 Bonds of Promise (Yakusoku no Kizuna, the music video) is TVDB 0x16 Bonds of Promise (2015-03-14); the stage greetings S2 and S3 have no TVDB episode. With no row they defaulted to 0x1-0x3, which are Idol Trial #1-#3 (AniDB 9518 S2-S4).",
